@startuml
title FT-013-02 — Conversion job lifecycle

actor Student
participant "Vue client" as UI
participant "Library API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Conversion worker" as Worker
participant "Isolated renderer" as Renderer
participant "LibraryObjectStore" as Store

Student -> UI: Convert original GP
UI -> API: POST conversion-jobs\nIdempotency-Key + If-Match + sourceAssetId
API -> DB: Lock owner material + source asset
API -> DB: Check owner, role, format, state, SHA, active job
API -> DB: Insert QUEUED job + request fingerprint
DB --> API: jobId, revision
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + job URL
UI -> UI: Store jobId in account/material-scoped sessionStorage

loop QUEUED / RUNNING / CANCEL_REQUESTED
  UI -> API: GET job (poll every 1.8s)
  API -> DB: Owner-scoped read
  DB --> API: State, stage, progress, revision
  API --> UI: Current job snapshot
end

Worker -> DB: Claim slot + QUEUED job\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
DB --> Worker: leaseOwner, leaseUntil, source snapshot
Worker -> Store: Open source object read-only
Worker -> Renderer: Import + inspect tracks\n(no network, bounded resources)
Renderer --> Worker: Track catalog

alt Several guitar tracks
  Worker -> DB: Save tracks; state AWAITING_TRACK_SELECTION\nrelease global worker slot
  UI -> API: GET conversion job
  API -> DB: Read owner-scoped job
  DB --> API: state + safe track catalog
  API --> UI: AWAITING_TRACK_SELECTION + tracks
  UI -> UI: Stop polling; wait for explicit user choice
  Student -> UI: Select track
  UI -> API: POST track-selection + If-Match
  API -> DB: Validate trackIndex; state QUEUED
  DB --> API: Updated revision
  API --> UI: Selection accepted
UI -> UI: Resume polling
  Worker -> DB: Claim slot + selected job
else One guitar track
  Worker -> DB: Save automatic selection; continue
end

Worker -> Renderer: Render PDF + synthesize WAV\nsame imported score revision
Renderer --> Worker: Temporary PDF + WAV
Worker -> Worker: Validate both outputs and sizes
Worker -> DB: Reserve actual output quota
Worker -> Store: Store both derived assets
Worker -> DB: Atomic commit both assets + SUCCEEDED\nonly if leaseOwner/revision still match
UI -> API: GET conversion job
API -> DB: Read owner-scoped job
DB --> API: SUCCEEDED + output asset IDs
API --> UI: SUCCEEDED + PDF/WAV asset IDs
UI -> API: GET private material detail
API -> DB: Owner-scoped read of refreshed assets
DB --> API: DERIVED_SCORE_PDF + SYNTHESIZED_PREVIEW
API --> UI: Refreshed material DTO
UI -> UI: Verify both asset IDs/roles; show PDF reader + WAV player

opt Cancel
  Student -> UI: Cancel
  UI -> API: POST cancel
  API -> DB: CANCEL_REQUESTED
  API --> UI: Updated state + revision
  Worker -> Renderer: Stop process; cleanup scratch
  Worker -> DB: CANCELLED; release lease/slot
  UI -> API: GET final job state
  API --> UI: CANCELLED
end

opt Retry FAILED / TIMED_OUT when retryable
  Student -> UI: Retry
  UI -> API: POST retry + If-Match
  API -> DB: Validate state, retryable and attempt limit
  API --> UI: QUEUED + new revision
  UI -> UI: Resume polling
end

opt Failure / timeout
  Worker -> Renderer: Kill at 60s watchdog or capture safe error code
  Worker -> Worker: Delete temp/partial output
  Worker -> DB: FAILED / UNSUPPORTED / TIMED_OUT\nrelease lease/slot; keep original unchanged
end
@enduml
